%% Cross-system data lineage; arrows are data flows, not foreign keys.
%% Evidence: data-batch services, Excel upload handlers, D365FO integration, configuration.
%% Relationship catalog: ../04-relationship-catalog.md; this flowchart does not assert database relationships.
%% See ../08-integration-data-mapping.md for explanation and limitations.
flowchart LR
  Users[Frontend users] -->|HTTP/API requests| API[NestJS middleware API]
  API -->|persist batches, master cache, identity, queue metadata| Mongo[(MongoDB application store)]
  API -->|optional named log connection| Logs[(MongoDB log store; URI may fall back)]
  API -->|BullMQ, cache, log stream| Redis[(Redis transient/operational data)]
  API -->|OData reads and transaction writes| D365[Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations]
  Excel[Uploaded workbooks] -->|multipart upload and parsing| API
  BankFiles[Bank and IST workbooks] -->|multipart upload| BankApp[Bank ↔ IST reconciliation app]
  BankApp -->|download updated IST workbook| BankFilesOut[Generated workbook response]
  BankApp -.->|no persistence schema found| NoStore[Transient processing]
